{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-15_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-14","title":"旷野轰鸣","storyCode":"16-15","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-15_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2c8c35c612eadad493cb3cd4de829b9d487a77c421b16607b8f447163828053b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g2_farnorthgovernment"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说来奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我很喜欢布列斯克的这个季节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有太阳的东升西落，没有昼夜分明......人们也不用假装一切都很明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“多事之秋”，元帅他也是这么说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女大公殿下，时间紧迫。即使是在我享用您招待的这一杯热茶的时间里，局势也在不断变得紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帅在等待您的答复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连叶甫根尼元帅都坐不住了，看来乌萨斯真的面临着巨大的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您完全正确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这样的局势下，圣骏堡温吞的反应将不被接受——这不只是元帅一人的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时至今日，他应该早已理解，他的父亲在当年那场动乱中的举措堪称睿智——第四集团军本会有比发配边疆更坏的结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么如今，年轻的叶甫根尼，是下定决心要冲在眼下乱局的第一线了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永远站在离危险最近的地方保护乌萨斯——元帅在履行乌萨斯军人的天职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的问题，在于您，女大公殿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帅需要您还愿意维系往日的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是他对我的通知？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一个基于友谊的请求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帅他非常重视与您的友谊，同样也信任您的智慧。他相信，即使在这个时候，布列斯克与第四集团军的利益也是紧密相连的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况他并不请求您做什么额外的事——只要您的一个点头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来，他似乎认为这很容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道他将我们的皇帝陛下看作一个蠢材吗？难道维特议长也是一个蠢材吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是非此即彼的选择......就像太阳不会与黑夜共存。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帅非常理解您的处境，他当然愿意为您分忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，一位“皇帝的利刃”的陨落，有非常充分的解释空间，而元帅愿意替您做出这个解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“第四集团军协助布列斯克剿灭了发生在远北地区的叛乱”——只要您愿意合作，集团军呈交给圣骏堡的报告上，就只会有这样一句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至不必点头，您的沉默，元帅也可以接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......并非如此......如果元帅他真的理解我，就该知道我在意的从来不是来自圣骏堡的质疑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活在我的领地内的人民，乌萨斯的人民......我在意的只有他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"元帅理解您的仁慈，他向您保证，您划下的线，没有人可以逾越。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻的叶甫根尼，急躁的叶甫根尼......我又怎会愿意看到我亲爱的朋友以身涉险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕真的如他所愿，我保持沉默，这也不过是在他前行的崎路上抹去了一堆小小石子，那些巨大的山石他又准备如何处置？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些，就不劳女大公殿下烦忧了。无论是山石还是别的什么，元帅他有决心为乌萨斯战胜一切敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......我是否可以理解为，已经得到了您的答复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叶甫根尼元帅向您问好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"严肃的乌萨斯军官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1977_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为了乌萨斯的荣光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叶莉莎女大公","speakerId":"avg_npc_1962_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切为了乌萨斯的荣光......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅，你还好吗？需要的话我也可以抱着你们两人一起跑的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不用。我......还好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不明白......我们为什么......要这么急着赶路？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我有一个猜想......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果乌萨斯官方已经得知了矿脉的异变......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"能让远北所有的矿区都陷入沉寂，只有一种解释——","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"乌萨斯不会让矿脉枯竭的消息传播出去。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你看天空的颜色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们进来的时候，是这样的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......这是我的幻觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么又是......这样的颜色？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"narration","text":"醒目的、带着警示意味的红色。你甚至不需要特意抬头就能看到的颜色。\n它逐渐笼罩了原本是灰色的昏暗天幕，也笼罩了身处地面的一切。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......军队。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"乌萨斯军队的警示灯。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他们已经来了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么军队会在这个时候深入远北？他们根本不应该来到这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，西北方五公里处检测到大规模的高能源石反应，有人在快速向我们靠近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......马上回研究所。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"必须立刻告知阿米娅。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅，你还好吗？我们该加速了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，研究所......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要回研究所。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g9_institutecorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得应急通讯设备都放在顶楼的观景台里，钥匙在所长办公室——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）不是我们的脚步声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）这里还有其他人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"听起来人数不多。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没时间了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"要尽快通知阿米娅。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g10_instituteinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，这里没有应急灯，看不清。我已经点上蜡烛了，先将就一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错......通讯设备在这里。我没用过这种东西，不确定它能传递信号的距离有多远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是乌萨斯军用通讯器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你认识这种装置？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian有类似的装置——她年轻的时候曾参与过乌萨斯军方类似设备的研究，没想到他们竟然已经做出成果了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果和我知道的一样，那这就是一种高性能全域信息广播装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它搭载了一个功率极高的施术单元——功率大概相当于同时使用一百台普通军用级通讯器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的设计初衷，就是为了能大范围向军用设施发送急电。当然，擅长使用感知类源石技艺的人，比如Raidian，也能接收到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这难道不是好事？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你为什么这么紧张？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是它没有办法发送出特定频段的信号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是说，如果我们在这里使用这个装置发送了信息，不远处的乌萨斯军队也一定会接收到......我们的位置会立刻暴露。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......发送信息。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"发送信息，然后立刻转移。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，听你的，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把你要发出的信息告诉我，我来操作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"乌萨斯，矿脉正在全面枯竭。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已录入，还有呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科谢尼娅","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事？他们为什么要袭击研究所？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"至少有一支军队介入了远北事务。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他们会封锁消息——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，录入完毕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发送——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"立刻撤离！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，科谢尼娅，抓紧我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这就——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂......喂——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"该死......真不知道算赶上了还是没赶上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个怪物，你抓我的时候不是还挺厉害的吗，你可别轻易死在这啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"听到我的声音了吗？能听见吗——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
